.idea/
.vscode/
.superpowers/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated outputs and local state
outputs/
**/outputs/
**/output/
**/state/
**/data/raw/
**/data/processed/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite

# Bundled runtimes are installed, not source. Without these the first commit
# would have swept in ~12k files of node_modules under 本地推运营Agent_V1.
**/runtime/
**/node_modules/
**/.playwright-cli/

# Credentials, tokens, and live browser session data.
# agent/.env.txt holds DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, so the .env.* pattern is required:
# the previous rule only covered a bare "agent/.env" and would have let the
# real key into history. Patterns are prefix-free so the V1 tree is covered too.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.txt
!**/config.example.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
**/browser_download_config.json
**/browser_download_config*.json
!**/browser_download_config.example.json
**/browser_execution_config.json
**/shimo_sheet_config.json
pushplus token.txt

# Handoff docs and probe scripts that name a real account, project, or document.
